// 289's Peksa (areas/area_barbarian_village/scripts/peksa.rs2), word for word. No 2011 recording
// of her was found; void-634's adds "Well, come back if you change your mind." after "No, I'll
// pass on that." (its comment cites RS3 and Old School, not 2011), so 289's stands.
// Waiting: Scorpion Catcher at 647 (289's quests/quest_scorpcatcher); with it, 289's third option
// ("I've heard you have a small scorpion in your possession.") returns.
[opnpc1,peksa]
~chatnpc("<p,quiz>Are you interested in buying or selling a helmet?");
def_int $option = ~p_choice2("I could be, yes.", 1, "No, I'll pass on that.", 2);
if($option = 1) {
    ~chatplayer("<p,neutral>I could be, yes.");
    ~openshop_activenpc;
} else if($option = 2) {
    ~chatplayer("<p,neutral>No, I'll pass on that.");
}
